Why a message is where it is: people, Reading, Paper trail or screened out, and the rule that decided it

Usage: mxr why [OPTIONS] <MESSAGE_ID>

Arguments:
  <MESSAGE_ID>

Options:
      --format <FORMAT>  [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help             Print help
